flowchart TD
    A([CSE Uploads Telemetry File<br/>CSV or JSON]) --> B[POST /api/ingest/{cse_id}/{data_type}]
    B --> C{Stage 1: Validate<br/>Schema + required fields}
    C -->|Invalid rows| R1[(rejects table)]
    C -->|Valid rows| D[Stage 2: Clean<br/>Dedup + whitespace trim]
    D --> E[Stage 3: Normalize<br/>Severity canonical<br/>Timestamps to ISO-8601 UTC<br/>IP validation]
    E --> F[Stage 4: Entity Mapping<br/>Extract IPs, analysts, assets<br/>-> entities table]
    F --> G[Stage 5: Store<br/>Write to alerts/cases/escalations<br/>assets tables]
    G --> H[(ingest_batches table<br/>batch summary)]
    H --> I[POST /api/analytics/run]
    I --> J1[RuleEngine<br/>4 YAML rules]
    I --> J2[AnomalyDetectionEngine<br/>Z-score + Isolation Forest]
    I --> J3[PeerBenchmarkingEngine<br/>Cohort median comparison]
    I --> J4[ExecutionGapEngine<br/>MTTR Z-score + TF-IDF]
    I --> J5[NegativeSpaceEngine<br/>Silent assets + coverage gaps]
    J1 & J2 & J3 & J4 & J5 --> K[persist_findings<br/>DELETE + INSERT idempotent]
    K --> L[(findings table)]
    L --> M[update_risk_scores<br/>6-component composite 0-100]
    M --> N[(risk_scores table<br/>INSERT OR REPLACE)]
    N --> O[POST /api/traceback/run]
    O --> P[Cluster incidents<br/>NetworkX components]
    P --> Q[Build attack path<br/>5 MITRE stages]
    Q --> R[LLM generate narrative<br/>MockLLM or Ollama]
    R --> S[verify_llm_claims<br/>Strip hallucinated IDs]
    S --> T[(traceback_reports table)]
    T --> U[Supervisor Dashboard<br/>React Frontend]
    U --> V[Human Review<br/>POST /api/reviews/]
    V --> W[(reviews table)]
    W --> X{Decision?}
    X -->|FALSE_POSITIVE| Y[(feedback_logs table<br/>PENDING proposal)]
    X -->|VALID / NEEDS_MORE_DATA| Z[(audit_logs table)]
    Y --> Z
    Z --> AA[Supervisor approves/rejects<br/>POST /api/feedback/approve]
    AA --> AB[Export PDF / CSV<br/>GET /api/export/*]
